  "slug": "italian-tuna-spread",
  "name": "Italian Tuna Spread",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "This recipe blends canned tuna with capers, lemon juice, parsley, and butter for a tuna spread with Italian flair for your antipasto platter or sandwiches.",
  "cuisine": "Italian Inspired",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine tuna, butter, capers, parsley, lemon juice, salt, and black pepper in the bowl of a food processor; pulse until smooth."
    }
